        {
          "start": 1,
          "span": 5,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Empathy Map</h2><p>To align the team on real user needs, I created an empathy map for both borrowers and lenders. It summarizes what each group says, thinks, does, and feels, based on stakeholder input and user observation.</p>"
