        {
          "start": 4,
          "span": 9,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<p>Mapped 80+ screens covering both the borrower and lender flows - homepage, results, item view, listing creation, checkout, and messaging. Low-fidelity wireframes validated structure before visual design.</p><ul><li><p>Borrower Flow - 40+ screens</p></li><li><p>Lender Flow - 30+ screens</p></li><li><p>Shared Flows - Messaging, Auth, Onboarding</p></li></ul>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
