        },
        {
          "start": 7,
          "span": 6,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Experience 1 - Discover locally</h2><p>Borrowing starts with a simple question: <strong>is there one near me?</strong></p><p>I designed the home screen to answer that immediately, categories up top, then two shelves of real items close by. Each card includes the full trust anatomy at a glance: the lender’s face and first name, distance, star rating, and price up front.</p><p>Search follows the way people naturally think, what, where, when, with a calendar for fixed dates and a Flexible toggle when the job can wait. The goal was simple: borrowers should know who they’d be dealing with and how far they’d walk before they ever tap into a listing.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6a4c29b3c75c754a4951f331",
      "kind": "gallery",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 1,
          "span": 12,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "image",
