    {
      "id": "section-6a4c2738c75c754a4950ca61",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 1,
          "span": 6,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Experience 2 - Trust &amp; book</h2><p>This is the moment the marketplace exists for: a stranger deciding to trust another stranger. On the card, ratings round to whole stars for browse speed — the item view is where the exact score unlocks: 5.0 across 22 reviews, sitting right beside the price.</p><p>From here, everything the borrower needs to commit is one scroll away — the lender&#x27;s verified identity, real borrower quotes, their location on the map — and the two actions that matter stay pinned: pick dates, send a request. Not &quot;pay now&quot; — a request.</p><p>Nothing is charged until the lender accepts. Trust first, money later; that order is the design.</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
