        },
        {
          "start": 7,
          "span": 6,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Experience 3 — List in 2 minutes</h2><p>Every decision here targets the same enemy, the blank form.</p><p>The entry point is <strong>a choice, not a default</strong>, AI Quick Listing is offered, never forced. Photo guidance asks for specific angles and a brand label because that’s what the model needs to draft accurately.</p><p>The draft then lands in the familiar form, <strong>pre-filled but fully editable</strong>, so it’s a new capability with no new UI to learn. And the beta disclaimer is not small print, it’s the trust contract: AI drafts, the lender approves. Nothing reaches the marketplace until a human signs off.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
