        {
          "start": 7,
          "span": 6,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Experience 4 — <strong>Message centre</strong></h2><p>Every exchange is a conversation, so we built the exchange flow around chat. Structured Action Cards keep key decisions, approve, confirm pickup, propose a new time, or mark as returned, right inside the thread. Once it’s done, the conversation closes with a review, feeding the trust signals that support the rest of the product.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6a4d80e66aad411f852c5d67",
      "kind": "chapter",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 1,
          "span": 12,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Test</h2>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section-6a4ee117ef6caf3ed647ae24",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 1,
          "span": 5,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2>Test 1 — Item card</h2><p>Ahead of launch, the initial item card was redesigned and two options were taken through an internal review with stakeholders.</p><p><strong>Option B</strong> won: lender identity leading, ratings rounded to whole stars, condition moved one tap deeper — the hierarchy of photo → person → item → trust → price that now anchors every listing surface.</p>"
            }
          ]
        },
