    {
      "id": "section-6a4ee1c5ef6caf3ed647ef6b",
      "kind": "content",
      "columns": [
        {
          "start": 1,
          "span": 12,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<h2><strong>More testing and iterations coming soon ...</strong></h2><p><strong>Lendit is live</strong> — and this case study grows with it. If it taught me one thing: trust isn&#x27;t a feature you add, it&#x27;s an order you put things in.</p><p>Thanks for reading — get in touch anytime.</p>"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
